    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One rainy day you come home from the store and find a wounded fox on the road. In spite of your strict parents who forbid you to have pets, you decide to take her in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you take good care of her if you don't even know what foxes eat?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel deals with mature themes and may not be appropriate for those who are easily disturbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never Trust a Fox \u2014 is a mystical thriller visual novel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystic thriller/horror story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pet a cute foxgirl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices-driven branching narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret discovery journal</p></li></ul>",
